{"id":"en_i-can-see-my-husband-s-loyalty","title":"I Can See My Husband's Loyalty","titleEn":"I Can See My Husband's Loyalty","description":"Claire possesses an unusual ability: she can perceive the degree of loyalty that others hold toward her. This gift becomes painfully clear when her father betrays her mother, and Claire witnesses his loyalty score drop sharply to twenty-three percent. A similar moment follows involving her sister, revealing how those closest to her truly feel. The story centers on Claire's burden of seeing devotion measured so plainly, and the emotional consequences that come with such knowledge. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-can-see-my-husbands-loyalty/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-can-see-my-husbands-loyalty/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6skk/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-can-see-my-husband-s-loyalty_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6skk/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-can-see-my-husband-s-loyalty_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6skk/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-can-see-my-husband-s-loyalty_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6skk/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-can-see-my-husband-s-loyalty_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/emb